---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Contact" description="How to reach me; how to book tutoring sessions.">
  <h1>Contact</h1>

  <p>The fastest way to reach me is email. For tutoring slots, use the booking link below.</p>

  <h2>Direct</h2>

  <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; line-height: 2;">
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:ianthelfrich@gmail.com">ianthelfrich@gmail.com</a></li>
    <li><strong>iMessage:</strong> same address (Apple ID)</li>
    <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/ihelfrich" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@ihelfrich</a></li>
    <li><strong>ORCID:</strong> (in progress)</li>
    <li><strong>Mailing:</strong> Atlanta, GA, USA</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Tutoring</h2>

  <p>I take a small number of tutoring clients at any given time, in:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Intermediate microeconomics (Mas-Colell, Varian, Nicholson level)</li>
    <li>Intermediate macroeconomics (Case-Fair-Oster, Mankiw, Romer level)</li>
    <li>Econometrics (Wooldridge, Stock-Watson, Hansen level)</li>
    <li>Applied causal inference (the <a href="https://ihelfrich.github.io/inference-lab/">Inference Lab</a> material)</li>
    <li>Corporate finance and capital markets (MBA-level)</li>
    <li>Reading-and-replicating econ papers (most useful for graduate students and pre-doctoral fellows)</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Book a 30-minute introductory consult below. After that initial call we'll set a regular cadence and agree on rates.</p>

  <h2>Book a consult</h2>

  <div style="margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: 1.2rem; background: var(--paper-2); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: 6px;">
    <p style="margin-top: 0;"><strong>Booking widget pending.</strong></p>
    <p>I'm setting up a <a href="https://cal.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cal.com</a> account at <code>cal.com/ianhelfrich</code>. Once it's live, this section will embed the booking widget so you can pick a slot directly.</p>
    <p>In the meantime, <a href="mailto:ianthelfrich@gmail.com?subject=Tutoring%20consult%20request">email me</a> with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>What you're working on (course / paper / qualifying exam / project)</li>
      <li>Your level (undergrad / grad / postdoc / industry)</li>
      <li>Your timezone</li>
      <li>Two or three time windows that work for a 30-min call this week or next</li>
    </ul>
    <p>I usually reply within 24 hours.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Research correspondence</h2>

  <p>If you're writing about a paper, dataset, or collaboration request, please use email rather than the booking widget. Include the paper title and what you're proposing in the subject line. I read everything; I reply to most.</p>

  <h2>Press / media</h2>

  <p>For press inquiries, email with "PRESS" in the subject line. I'm available to talk about U.S. blended finance, NMTC, EU Cohesion / rural credit, applied causal inference, and related topics. I don't comment on current U.S. partisan politics or stock-market predictions.</p>
</Base>
